# Gate 2 — Verify Existing Resource Groups

List your Azure Resource Groups:

```powershell
Get-AzResourceGroup
```

Look for:

```text
SEIR-DEV
SEIR-PROD
```

If both Resource Groups already exist, continue to Gate 3.

