# Challenge 1 — Who Can Do What?

Given:

```text
SEIR_Developers
        |
        v
Contributor @ SEIR-DEV
```

and:

```text
SEIR_Prod_Readers
        |
        v
Reader @ SEIR-PROD
```

Chewbacca is a member of both groups.

Answer:

### Can Chewbacca view SEIR-DEV?

```text
YES
```

### Can Chewbacca modify SEIR-DEV?

```text
YES
```

### Can Chewbacca view SEIR-PROD?

```text
YES
```

### Can Chewbacca modify SEIR-PROD?

```text
NO
```

